  "notes": "{低迷|ていめい} describes being stuck at a low level without improvement — a prolonged slump or period of poor performance.\n\nFORMS:\n⟦{低|てい}→低〜：03961_tei⟧ (low) + {迷|めい} (lost, confused)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{景気|けいき}→景気：02694_keiki⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低迷|ていめい}: economic slump\n- ⟦{業績|ぎょうせき}→業績：04873_gyouseki⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低迷|ていめい}: sluggish business performance\n- ⟦{株価|かぶか}→株価：05154_kabuka⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{低迷|ていめい}: stagnant stock prices\n- {低迷|ていめい}⟦から→から：00504_kara⟧⟦{脱|だっ}する→脱する：28650_dassuru⟧: to break out of a slump\n- ⟦{長期|ちょうき}→長期：03487_chouki⟧{低迷|ていめい}: prolonged stagnation\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{停滞|ていたい}→停滞：07427_teitai⟧: stagnation (lack of progress, broader use)\n- ⟦{不振|ふしん}→不振：07771_fushin⟧: poor performance, slump\n- ⟦{不況|ふきょう}→不況：04844_fukyou⟧: recession (specifically economic)\n⟦{好調|こうちょう}→好調：12209_kouchou⟧ (favorable, thriving), ⟦{回復|かいふく}→回復：03812_kaifuku⟧ (recovery)",
